sequenceDiagram
 participant U as Reporter
 participant A as Mobile app
 participant Q as Local queue
 participant API as iRespond API
 U->>A: Describe need + optional location
 A->>A: Save local draft
 U->>A: Capture safe evidence
 U->>A: Submit observation
 A->>Q: Queue idempotent report
 A->>API: Flush queue when reachable
 API-->>A: Created / replay-safe response
 A->>Q: Remove synced item
